wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T09:51:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T09:51:41Z","body":"@AThousandShips I'm building with MSVC","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883367081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883447116","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116163#issuecomment-3883447116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116163","id":3883447116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7neLNM","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T10:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T10:08:00Z","body":"Can you try with mingw or other options with that setting on? This might be a limitation of MSVC (which we don't recommend using for production)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883447116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883581376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116163#issuecomment-3883581376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116163","id":3883581376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ner_A","user":{"login":"RoyalXXX","id":125651292,"node_id":"U_kgDOB31JXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125651292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyalXXX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T10:34:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T10:34:48Z","body":"@AThousandShips I compiled using the command:\n\n`scons platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64 d3d12=no use_mingw=yes`\n\nusing g++ 15.2.0 (from mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-gcc from MSYS2).\n\nThe issue with adding unnecessary file paths to the binary is not observed, which means **this issue only occurs when compiling with MSVC**.\n\nHowever, I prefer MSVC because the template size is always significantly smaller than when compiling with GNU GCC + MinGW.\nFor example, if a Godot 4.6 template without D3D12 compiled with MSVC is **64 MB**, the same template when compiled with GNU GCC + MinGW is **82 MB**. In both cases, this refers to normal compilation without additional options for reducing size at the expense of speed.\nAdditionally, MSVC generally compiles faster and is a better compiler overall. I constantly find bugs and ISO C++ non-conformance issues when working with GNU GCC.\nI would like you to find a solution to the problem of adding unnecessary file paths to the binary when compiling with MSVC.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883581376/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883610432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116163#issuecomment-3883610432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116163","id":3883610432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nezFA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T10:39:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T10:39:47Z","body":"This might not be trivial, and I'd say the general solution is to use gcc or similar as we do not recommend MSVC for production for [various reasons](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.html#selecting-a-compiler)\n\nUnless there's a simple solution to this I suspect it's unlikely we will fix this as most people will not use MSVC for production for those reasons, and we don't use it for our built templates so we will be less able to extensively test it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883610432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883676603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116163#issuecomment-3883676603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116163","id":3883676603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nfDO7","user":{"login":"AThousandShi